Description: Minimal 4K screen recorder for Linux (X11)
 Azravibe Recorder is a fast, native screen recorder for Linux (X11).
 Record your entire display, an individual monitor, or any window,
 with system or microphone audio, saved as H.264/AAC MP4 with
 cursor compositing and 4K UHD upscaling.
 Homepage: https://github.com/11nawid/azravibe-recorder
